<div class="article-detail-page">
    <div class="article-body">

        <p>As you buy on Lively, if you ship to an APO, FPO, or DPO address, you must format it correctly.</p>
        <p>If you don't, your package may be delayed or your order may be canceled.</p>

        <h2 id="format">Use this format</h2>

        <p>When you <a href="#">add your shipping address</a>, enter:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Name:</strong> Your full first and last name</li>
            <li><strong>Address line 1:</strong> Unit / PSC / Box number</li>
            <li><strong>Address line 2 (optional):</strong> Additional unit / box info</li>
            <li><strong>City:</strong> APO, FPO, or DPO</li>
            <li><strong>State:</strong> AA, AE or AP</li>
            <li><strong>Country:</strong> United States</li>
            <li><strong>ZIP code:</strong> Your assigned military ZIP code</li>
        </ul>

        <p>Don't enter your base name or overseas country in the <strong>City</strong> field.</p>

        <p><strong>Example:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Name:</strong> Jordan Smith</li>
            <li><strong>Address line 1:</strong> PSC 123</li>
            <li><strong>Address line 2:</strong> Box 4567</li>
            <li><strong>City:</strong> APO</li>
            <li><strong>State:</strong> AE</li>
            <li><strong>ZIP code:</strong> 09012</li>
            <li><strong>Country:</strong> United States</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="avoid-issues">Avoid address entry issues</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>Use English characters only. Replace special characters with the closest English equivalent.</li>
            <li>Use a full first and last name.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="article-info-box">
            <strong>Seller tip:</strong> If you're shipping to an APO/FPO/DPO address, both the recipient and sender name must include a first and last name (even if you use a business name). Each name field must be more than 1 character.
        </div>

        <h2 id="before-checkout">Before checkout</h2>

        <p>Check your <a href="#">default shipping address</a> and confirm:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>City</strong> is APO/FPO/DPO</li>
            <li><strong>State</strong> is AA/AE/AP</li>
            <li><strong>ZIP</strong> matches the assigned military ZIP</li>
            <li>Unit/PSC/Box numbers are included</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="article-info-box">
            <strong>Tip:</strong> Review <a href="#">USPS military address guidelines</a> to confirm your address will be accepted.
        </div>

        <div class="helpful-widget">
            <p>Was this article helpful?</p>
